{"id":551520,"title":"Better Fps - Render Distance","summary":"Better FPS Render Distance is a mod which adds a few performance improvements to increase fps.","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:18px\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/38401808/163135435-3e70640f-daf9-447a-96de-25cf8d0a2f61.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1344\" height=\"50\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:18px\"\u003eBetter FPS Render Distance is a mod which adds a few performance improvements to increase fps.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:18px\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eRender distance:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:18px\"\u003eBy default minecraft renders everything in a square radius(cylinder in 1.18), this is changed to a 3d circular radius which can be stretched horizontally and vertically via config or video option(video options button is not available with optifine). The higher the stretch the less caves below you will be rendered, esp distant ones. Provides about 10-35% less chunk sections to be rendered and thus gives a neat fps boost.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:18px\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cupboard\" rel=\"nofollow\"\u003eRequires \u003cstrong\u003eCupboard\u003c/strong\u003e dependency to be installed in newer versions\u003c/a\u003e \u003cbr\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/38401808/162617552-80038ed3-026b-42e1-8133-c00f6f9ad45e.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1344\" height=\"50\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:18px\"\u003eSet horizontal render distance scaling\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:18px\"\u003eSet vertical render distance scaling\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:18px\"\u003eChoose if the adjust distance should also affect the range at which entities render\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:18px\"\u003eDebug mode to display effects\u003c/span\u003e\u003cimg style=\"font-size:18px\" src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/38401808/163059508-bfcdb9fc-5f49-4204-afff-d9ae9460beda.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1344\" height=\"50\"\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:14px\"\u003eIf you want to use this with Distant Horizons, set the vertical stretch to 100% and horizontal to 0%\u003cbr\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:18px\"\u003eOnly required on clientside. Can be put on serverside but does nothing there.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/38401808/162635503-85e3e64b-3263-4498-944e-ba9741a3c88d.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1344\" height=\"50\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIf you enjoy this mod consider supporting the development, any support is greatly appreciated.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe development is an unpaid free-time activity, so any support helps being able to spend more time on it.\u003cbr\u003eYou can support me on Patreon, or just spreading the word around.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://www.patreon.com/someaddons\" rel=\"nofollow\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/38401808/162637017-9a30d47b-493d-4743-9029-ac09dcc438f9.png\" width=\"300\" height=\"29\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e","game":"minecraft","type":"Mods","urls":{"curseforge":"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-fps-render-distance","project":"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-fps-render-distance"},"thumbnail":"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/531/771/256/256/637854357042030339.png","created_at":"2021-12-02T12:15:00.793Z","downloads":{